            "snippets": [
              "The reaction in financial futures was immediate overnight to China's retaliatory action.\nBusiness\nTech\nVideo\nPRO",
              "# Watch how futures markets in stocks, soybeans and the dollar tanked suddenly overnight on the China trade retaliation\nPublished Wed, Apr 4 2018 8:01 AM EDT Updated Wed, Apr 4 2018 10:05 AM EDT\n\nthumbnail\n\nJohn Melloy@johnmelloy\n\nWATCH LIVE\n\nFinancial markets from stocks to soybeans plunged suddenly in overnight trading as China hit back at President Donald Trump's trade actions much faster than expected",
